.pure-g.collection-columns
	.pure-u-1.pure-u-md-1-2
		:markdown
			## A growing tsumego library

			These collections bring together life-and-death problems for study and
			exploration, whether you prefer solving on paper or reading on screen.

			For a steady course of study, start with the volume of Cho Chikun's
			*Encyclopedia of Life &amp; Death* closest to your level. If you'd rather
			follow your curiosity, dip into one of the classical collections:
			each has its own character and challenges.

			Every collection comes in two PDF formats: a two-column A5 booklet
			for printing, and a smaller, one-column A6 version for reading on a phone.

