			## 2026 updates

			Four more classics join the library: *Guanzi Pu*, *Shikatsu Myoki*,
			*Wangyou Qingle Ji*, and *Gokyo Seimyo*.
			Everything's been redone, for both booklet and mobile formats:

			- everything is aligned to the grid
			- problems are padded so the columns are equal height
			- many other minor visual improvements

